 "completeness": "partial: enamel and dentine thicknesses not reported (measured at 10-30 points but not tabulated), no burial depths, U errors only as a generic +-0.02 ppm; ROSY inputs D_sed(t) and D_cos(t) are given per subsample, so internal+dentine beta can be tested only with assumed thicknesses",
 "extraction_notes": "Paper in Russian; tables read via WebFetch three times (Table 4 twice with identical numbers, Table 2 twice: per-row values once, ranges and means confirmed in the second read). Values in Table 2 with superscript 2 are assumed means, not measurements. Text: ~20 um of alpha-irradiated enamel removed (sides not specified; stored as removed_um_side_unspecified). Coordinates were extracted as Medzhibozh 1: 49°35'40\"N 27°42'23\"E, 270 m; Medzhibozh A: 49°25'48\"N 27°23'08\"E -- not entered as lat/lon because the two sites appear too far apart for neighbouring localities; verify before use. Table 1 X/Y/Z are excavation-grid coordinates in cm, not burial depths.",
